                                                "sense_id": "ee9a720b-a398-3486-9e9f-0c09e9f436c0",
                                                "text": "The approach to Newcastle (Central) Station from the north after a heavy snowfall. The complicated track layout is thrown into clear relief by the snow [referring to dark rails poking through the snow]"
